#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:202
msgid ""
"Subscribe form submissions to a Newsman list. The selected email field is "
"used as the subscriber email; the chosen properties are pushed as Newsman "
"subscriber properties."
msgstr ""
"Iscrivi gli invii del modulo a una lista Newsman. Il campo email selezionato "
"è usato come email dell'iscritto; le proprietà scelte vengono inviate come "
"proprietà dell'iscritto Newsman."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:208
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:273
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:392
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:81
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:279
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:197
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:221
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:214
msgid "Send to Newsman"
msgstr "Invia a Newsman"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:219
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:197
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:216
msgid ""
"When enabled, every successful submission of this form is subscribed to the "
"selected Newsman list."
msgstr ""
"Quando attivato, ogni invio riuscito di questo modulo viene iscritto alla "
"lista Newsman selezionata."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:225
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:283
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:104
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:198
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:227
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:225
msgid "Newsletter form"
msgstr "Modulo newsletter"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:236
msgid ""
"When enabled, submissions are routed to the Newsman list and segment "
"configured in Newsman - Sync (the per-form Newsman list and Segment rows "
"below are hidden because they no longer apply)."
msgstr ""
"Quando abilitato, gli invii vengono indirizzati all'elenco e segmento "
"Newsman configurati in Newsman - Sync (le righe Elenco e Segmento Newsman "
"per modulo sottostanti sono nascoste perché non si applicano più)."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:242
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:199
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:233
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:245
msgid "Newsman list"
msgstr "Lista Newsman"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:247
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:237
msgid ""
"No Newsman lists are available. Configure your Newsman API key on the "
"Newsman settings page first."
msgstr ""
"Nessuna lista Newsman disponibile. Configura prima la tua chiave API Newsman "
"nella pagina delle impostazioni Newsman."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:251
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:172
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:140
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:172
msgid "— select a list —"
msgstr "— seleziona una lista —"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:259
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:248
msgid ""
"List for this campaign-specific form. Ignored when \"Newsletter form\" is on "
"(the configured Sync list is used instead)."
msgstr ""
"Elenco per questo modulo specifico della campagna. Ignorato quando «Modulo "
"newsletter» è attivato (viene utilizzato l'elenco Sync)."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:260
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:296
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:147
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:199
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:248
msgid ""
"Do not pick the same list as the one configured in Newsman - Sync unless you "
"intend submissions to land in your global newsletter list. To send to that "
"list, turn on \"Newsletter form\" instead."
msgstr ""
"Non scegliere la stessa lista configurata in Newsman - Sync a meno che tu "
"non voglia che gli invii arrivino nella tua lista newsletter globale. Per "
"inviare a quella lista, attiva invece \"Newsletter form\"."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:278
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:200
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:243
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:270
msgid "Newsman segment"
msgstr "Segmento Newsman"

