msgstr "— nessuno —"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:290
msgid ""
"Optional. Segments are list-scoped — only segments belonging to the selected "
"list above are shown. Changing the list refreshes this dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Opzionale. I segmenti sono vincolati alla lista — vengono mostrati solo "
"isegmenti che appartengono alla lista selezionata sopra. Cambiando la lista,"
"questo menu a tendina si aggiorna."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:304
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:332
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:203
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:201
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:253
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:318
msgid "Opt-in mode"
msgstr "Modalità di opt-in"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:309
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:323
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:206
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:256
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:321
msgid "Single opt-in"
msgstr "Opt-in singolo"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:312
#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:327
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:207
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:257
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:322
msgid "Double opt-in"
msgstr "Doppio opt-in"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:316
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:214
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:201
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:325
msgid ""
"Single opt-in subscribes the user immediately. Double opt-in sends a "
"confirmation email; the subscription is only completed once the user clicks "
"the link."
msgstr ""
"L'opt-in singolo iscrive immediatamente l'utente. Il doppio opt-in invia "
"un'email di conferma; l'iscrizione viene completata solo quando l'utente fa "
"clic sul link."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:322
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:202
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:303
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:361
msgid "Email field"
msgstr "Campo email"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:327
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:350
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:376
#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:402
msgid "Add a field to the form template to enable Newsman."
msgstr "Aggiungi un campo al modello del modulo per attivare Newsman."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:338
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:364
msgid ""
"The selected field provides the subscriber email. Any field type may be used "
"(text, tel, url, email, …)."
msgstr ""
"Il campo selezionato fornisce l'email dell'iscritto. Può essere usato "
"qualsiasi tipo di campo (text, tel, url, email, …)."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:345
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:203
#: includes/gravityforms/class-formpanel.php:313
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:379
msgid "Firstname field"
msgstr "Campo nome"

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:364
#: includes/wpforms/class-formpanel.php:382
msgid ""
"Optional. When set, the field value is sent as the subscriber's firstname "
"instead of being included in the subscriber properties."
msgstr ""
"Opzionale. Quando impostato, il valore del campo viene inviato come nome "
"dell'iscritto invece di essere incluso nelle proprietà dell'iscritto."

#: includes/contactform7/class-formpanel.php:371
